  "provenance": {
    "kind": "storage",
    "note": "`set_player`, `set_club` and `set_mishit` overwrite one swing, leave its neighbours and each other's field alone, stamp `updated_at`, and answer None for a missing swing or a corrupt manifest, which stays as it was. `set_mishit` takes each verdict and None, which clears it. A manifest written before the three fields gains all three on its first save, through `manifest.tmp`, so a stale tmp file of that name is consumed",
